      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ルルのお父様が、ヴァンダル商会の新しくできた\n新支部のことを気にしてて……その情報を、\nカリアネイラの港で集めて\n報告して貰えないかな？　お願いです！",
        "official_en": "My father's been pretty concerned about Vandahl\nTrading's new branch, which means it's time for\nsome sneaky spying! Could you gather some info\nabout it at Callianeira Port and report to him?",
        "real_en": "My father's been pretty concerned about Vandahl\nTrading's new branch, which means it's time for\nsome sneaky spying! Could you gather some info\nabout it at Carianeira Port and report to him?"
      },
